    <div class="sia-story">
      <div class="sia-step sia-step--light">
        <div class="sia-step__card" data-reveal>
          <div class="sia-step__panel glass-3d">
            <div class="sia-step__text">
              <p class="sia-phil__label">The place</p>
              <h3 class="sia-step__title">A space to unwind.</h3>
              <p>A welcoming, peaceful setting where the pace feels different. A little distance from the everyday, with room to settle in and make time for yourself.</p>
            </div>
            <figure class="sia-step__inset img-reveal">
              <Img src={morningRoom} alt="A calm treatment room in morning light: folded white linen on a timber bench, a tea set and a branch of white blossom" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 18vw, 100vw" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sia-step sia-step--mid">
        <div class="sia-step__card" data-reveal>
          <div class="sia-step__panel glass-3d">
            <figure class="sia-step__inset img-reveal">
              <Img src={traditionHands} alt="A therapist’s hands resting gently on a guest’s back" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 26vw, 100vw" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
            </figure>
            <div class="sia-step__text">
              <p class="sia-phil__label">The tradition</p>
              <h3 class="sia-step__title">Chinese relaxation massage.</h3>
              <p>Discover the people and cultural background behind Sia Massage, and the massage experience at the heart of the business.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sia-step sia-step--dark">
        <div class="sia-step__card" data-reveal>
          <div class="sia-step__panel glass-3d">
            <div class="sia-step__text">
              <p class="sia-phil__label">The experience</p>
              <h3 class="sia-step__title">Care in every visit.</h3>
              <p>From the welcome you receive to the atmosphere of the treatment room, the little details help make your visit comfortable and enjoyable.</p>
              <blockquote>When the body is at ease, the heart follows.</blockquote>
              <div class="sia-step__cta"><a href="#treatments" class="btn-3d">Explore treatments</a></div>
            </div>
            <figure class="sia-step__inset img-reveal">
              <Img src={shopFront} alt="The Sia Massage studio front, with a therapist smiling as she welcomes a guest at the carved timber counter" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw" class="h-full w-full object-cover sia-step__shop" />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
